<Layout lang="en" title="How to Become a Stuntman? — Ilian Simeonow"  description="Requirements, training paths and Ilian Simeonow's personal recommendations for anyone who wants to become a stuntman." heroImage="/images/stunt/Double-Blond-Woman-1.jpg">

